basilisk

basilisk is a Rust reimplementation of Ghidra (https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra).
Its algorithms, behaviour and test cases are ported from Ghidra's Java and C++ source, which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and it reads Ghidra's processor specification
files (SLEIGH, .ldefs, .pspec, .cspec, .opinion) unchanged.

Ghidra's own notice follows.

